Yes. I would expand it, but not by simply adding more branches to the existing tree. At this point, WORLD // NEXUS is becoming a genuine planetary knowledge architecture, so the schema should distinguish what exists, what happens, what connects things, what establishes legal meaning, and what proves an assertion.


For Phase 0, I'd integrate all five missing domains, while implementing only a minimal vertical slice of each.


